'''Violated Chivalry''' (けがれなき騎士道, ''Kegarenaki Kishidō'', '''Pure Chivalry''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Massive Damage" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

